_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"4h5-Tyev0jX1GsuzUo_rYw","review_id":"CXTrWwHZct2ryXavI3Yeog","date":"2016-01-24T04:11:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9296135306358337,"text_excerpt":"I love that this place is here. Great food, excellent service! This place is for adults 21 and over (alcohol / gambling). You have a good selection of daiquiris and seasonal ones like around Mardi Gras (their mixture for the King Cake daiquiri hits you with tons of sweetness, before you realize the alcohol is trailing behind). Food here: depending on what you order, time ranges from 15-30 minutes. My only problem is with the amount of salt on the fries and prolly in the batter for onion rings and batter for the fish fry,"},{"business_id":"4h5-Tyev0jX1GsuzUo_rYw","review_id":"V8FkS7oJ_UPWXx54mF0NWw","date":"2017-12-16T16:06:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9277190566062927,"text_excerpt":"Daiquiris and good food. Tvs for sporting events. Good music. Video gaming machines. This is the spot. They have about 15 different flavors of daiquiris and also have beer and other liquors. They have specials several times a week for the daiquiris. They have a bunch of different po boys, fish, and other seafood plates and other sandwiches. I had a shrimp po boy and it was delicious. There were plenty of tasty shrimp and bread was fresh. The daiquiris are decent too. The bathroom is upstairs and small. Parking is limited but there is street parking and I've never had trouble finding a spot. Service is prompt and pleasant. I'll be coming back again and again."},{"business_id":"4h5-Tyev0jX1GsuzUo_rYw","review_id":"XWRNw1QWRc0BRXOnJglL6g","date":"2015-08-23T00:37:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9268910884857178,"text_excerpt":"I go here for the food not the drinks! The daquiris are decent but not strong and they are very sweet (I personally don't like sweet drinks) The service isn't bad. The atmosphere is friendly-go there to eat and hang out with a few friends. I often call in for takeout. Everything I have eaten from here was good and fresh."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"4h5-Tyev0jX1GsuzUo_rYw","photo_id":"kK_Gfd3WMfXBcoqgugsh2g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/kK_Gfd3WMfXBcoqgugsh2g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9670132398605347},{"business_id":"4h5-Tyev0jX1GsuzUo_rYw","photo_id":"TFTfgsGD8nfn2M-Z-Dfvqg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/TFTfgsGD8nfn2M-Z-Dfvqg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9670130014419556}]},"notebook_case":null}
